# A remembered machine is approached at its front square.  Treating the
# machine's own blocked tile as the step target skips the journey and leaves
# the following directional feed too far away to work.
name Step To Remembered Machine
dim 5 6
commands nearest step pickup giveto
ent worker 2 1
ent cube 1 1 7
ent shredder 2 4
goal shred_all
